		<Row Tag="LOC_ZG_PACE_PRESET_DESCRIPTION_BALANCED"><Text>Balanced: longer ages with Epic-style research. Sets Age Length to 153, 166, and 196 points by age, Age Progress Rate to Balanced, and Technology Cost and Civic Cost to High.</Text></Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_ZG_PACE_PRESET_DESCRIPTION_MULTIPLAYER"><Text>Multiplayer: a lighter stretch for sessions. Sets Age Length to 140, 155, and 190 points by age, Age Progress Rate to Balanced, Technology Cost to +35%, +50%, and +75% by age, Civic Cost to +45%, +60%, and +85%, City Growth to Slow, Roads to Fast (Express in Modern), and Modern Victory Project Cost to +20%.</Text></Row>
